# Python analyzer

- Target Python 3.12 unless the project explicitly upgrades after compatibility testing.
- Use type hints.
- Use Pydantic for API/domain boundary validation.
- Use Polars for columnar event/tick processing where practical.
- Use Parquet for high-volume tick data.
- Use SQLite only for application metadata and indexes.
- Keep FastAPI handlers thin; business logic lives in services/domain.
- Do not expose Awpy or demoparser2 dataframe schemas through the HTTP API.
- Every rule must be deterministic and unit tested.
- Every AI response must pass JSON-schema/domain validation before persistence.
- Log stable error codes, not only exception text.
